.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/assets/prompt-pack-iteration.md.tmpl:111:## OUTPUT CONTRACT
.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/assets/prompt-pack-iteration.md.tmpl:117:2. **Canonical iteration record recorded THROUGH THE APPEND GATEWAY** — never written to `{state_paths_state_log}` directly — the gateway is its only writer, and it refreshes that log from the ledger after authorizing, fencing, and receipting the record. The record MUST use `"type":"iteration"` EXACTLY, NOT `"iteration_delta"` or any other variant. The reducer counts records where `type === "iteration"` only; other types are silently ignored. Required schema:
.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/assets/prompt-pack-iteration.md.tmpl:120:{"type":"iteration","iteration":<n>,"mode":"review","target_agent":"deep-review","agent_definition_loaded":true,"resolved_route":"Resolved route: mode=review target_agent=deep-review","run":"<run-id>","status":"complete","focus":"<dimension-or-focus>","dimensions":["..."],"filesReviewed":["path:line"],"findingsCount":<n>,"findingsSummary":{"P0":<n>,"P1":<n>,"P2":<n>},"findingsNew":[],"findingDetails":[],"traceabilityChecks":{},"newFindingsRatio":<0..1>,"sessionId":"<session-id>","generation":<n>,"lineageMode":"new","timestamp":"<ISO-8601>","durationMs":<n>,"graphEvents":[/* optional */]}
.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/assets/prompt-pack-iteration.md.tmpl:131:- Each ledger row needs exactly one disposition link: `linkedFindingId` for `finding` (must match an id in `findingDetails[]`), `ruledOutReason` for `ruled_out`, `deferredReason` for `deferred`, `blockedReason` for `blocked`, or `notApplicableReason` for `not_applicable`.
.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/assets/prompt-pack-iteration.md.tmpl:143:Record this single JSON object through the append gateway — do NOT `echo`/`>>` it into `{state_paths_state_log}` (the gateway is its only writer and refreshes it from the ledger). Write the one-line record to a temp file, then run:
.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/assets/prompt-pack-iteration.md.tmpl:152:`--event-json` must name the SINGLE-record file (the gateway `JSON.parse`s it whole), never the multi-line `{state_paths_delta_pattern}`. Exit `0` = the record is durable in the ledger and the refreshed state_log carries it; exit `2` = refused → STOP and name the failed check. Never fall back to a direct write.
.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/assets/prompt-pack-iteration.md.tmpl:154:3. **Per-iteration delta file** at `{state_paths_delta_pattern}` (path pre-substituted, e.g. `deltas/iter-001.jsonl`). This file holds the structured delta stream for this iteration: one `{"type":"iteration",...}` record (same as the state-log append) plus per-event structured records (one per graphEvent, finding, classification, traceability-check, ruled_out direction). Each record on its own JSON line.
.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/assets/prompt-pack-iteration.md.tmpl:156:Example delta file contents (one review iteration):
.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/assets/prompt-pack-iteration.md.tmpl:158:{"type":"iteration","iteration":3,"mode":"review","target_agent":"deep-review","agent_definition_loaded":true,"resolved_route":"Resolved route: mode=review target_agent=deep-review","run":"run-001","status":"complete","focus":"correctness","dimensions":["correctness"],"filesReviewed":["path/to/file.ts:42"],"findingsCount":7,"findingsSummary":{"P0":0,"P1":2,"P2":5},"findingsNew":[],"findingDetails":[],"newFindingsRatio":0.41,"sessionId":"session-001","generation":1,"lineageMode":"new","timestamp":"2026-04-30T00:00:00Z","durationMs":120000,"graphEvents":[]}
.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/assets/prompt-pack-iteration.md.tmpl:164:All three artifacts are REQUIRED. The post_dispatch_validate step fails the iteration if any artifact is missing, malformed, or if the state-log append uses the wrong record type (`iteration_delta` etc.).
