.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review-confirm.yaml:1349:          command_note: "Mechanical leaf-reliability gate: exit 0 = complete; non-zero prints one machine reason (dispatch_failed|iteration_file_missing|iteration_verdict_missing|state_record_missing|route_proof_missing|route_proof_mismatch|delta_file_missing). dispatch_failed means the narrative is missing and the completion receipt shows a non-zero exit or a signal. The script enforces the artifact + route-proof contract instead of trusting the leaf to self-report, and a non-zero exit triggers on_failure.redispatch_once."
